{"symbol":"ICODEX","yahoo":"ICODEX.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Icodex Publishing Solutions Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","website":"https://icodexsolutions.com","about":"Icodex Publishing Solutions Limited provides software solutions to the scholarly and academic publishing industries in India. It offers Innovative Comprehensive Automated Publishing Platform, a cloud-based publishing workflow solution that streamlines the publishing process through the workflow and communication management, data transfer, and data storage; PaperPerfect, a manuscript refinement platform designed to support researchers, universities, and research institutions; eAssistant, a manuscript assessment system to meet publisher and journal-level requirements; and iProof, an online review and editing platform. The company also provides FlexyPage, an advanced HTML-based online layout processing system; Intelligent Mechanical and Technical Editing System, which is designed to convert word manuscripts into structured XML; iLang, an advanced language assessment and editing platform; iRef, an automated reference management platform that verifies, updates, and restructures references based on the required style; Product Data Hub and MetaScholar, which manages product and production specifications throughout the entire life cycle of an article or book; iPublish, a cloud-based digital library designed for the dissemination of publishing content; and ieBooks for digitizing books into popular formats, such as Kindle, Mobi, and iBook applications. In addition, it offers iDigit, an OCR system designed to create JATS XML from editable PDFs; and iWrite, a manuscript writing platform for researchers. Further, the company provides business process management services that support the publishing process with activities, including quality assurance checks, and editorial and back-end support services; and IT support services. It serves publishers, institutions and societies, researches and authors, government, and service providers. Icodex Publishing Solutions Limited was incorporated in 2018 and is based in Pune, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:29:13+00:00","quote":{"price":38.0,"prevClose":37.65,"marketCap":59.42,"high52":60.3,"low52":29.01,"pe":7.71,"bookValue":37.45,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":18.83,"shares":1.5637,"insiders":74.19,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-08-19","2025-08-20","2025-08-21","2025-08-22","2025-08-25","2025-08-26","2025-08-28","2025-08-29","2025-09-01","2025-09-02","2025-09-03","2025-09-04","2025-09-05","2025-09-08","2025-09-09","2025-09-10","2025-09-11","2025-09-12","2025-09-15","2025-09-16","2025-09-17","2025-09-18","2025-09-19","2025-09-22","2025-09-23","2025-09-24","2025-09-25","2025-09-26","2025-09-29","2025-09-30","2025-10-01","2025-10-03","2025-10-06","2025-10-07","2025-10-08","2025-10-09","2025-10-10","2025-10-13","2025-10-14","2025-10-15","2025-10-16","2025-10-17","2025-10-20","2025-10-21","2025-10-23","2025-10-24","2025-10-27","2025-10-28","2025-10-29","2025-10-30","2025-10-31","2025-11-03","2025-11-04","2025-11-06","2025-11-07","2025-11-10","2025-11-11","2025-11-12","2025-11-13","2025-11-14","2025-11-17","2025-11-18","2025-11-19","2025-11-20","2025-11-21","2025-11-24","2025-11-25","2025-11-26","2025-11-27","2025-11-28","2025-12-01","2025-12-02","2025-12-03","2025-12-04","2025-12-05","2025-12-08","2025-12-09","2025-12-10","2025-12-11","2025-12-12","2025-12-15","2025-12-16","2025-12-17","2025-12-18","2025-12-19","2025-12-22","2025-12-23","2025-12-24","2025-12-26","2025-12-29","2025-12-30","2025-12-31","2026-01-01","2026-01-02","2026-01-05","2026-01-06","2026-01-07","2026-01-08","2026-01-09","2026-01-12","2026-01-13","2026-01-14","2026-01-16","2026-01-19","2026-01-20","2026-01-21","2026-01-22","2026-01-23","2026-01-27","2026-01-28","2026-01-29","2026-01-30","2026-02-02","2026-02-03","2026-02-04","2026-02-05","2026-02-06","2026-02-09","2026-02-10","2026-02-11","2026-02-12","2026-02-13","2